<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said it qualified six bond deals for insurance slated for competitive sale on Monday.</p>
<p>--Litchfield Economic Development, Minn., $2.7 million housing bond issue.</p>
<p>Maple Grove, Minn., $4 million GOs, $15.7 million GOs and $6.4 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Oak Ridge, Tenn., $7 million of electric revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Oak Ridge, Tenn., $16 million of GO public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
